    "title": "Kennedy to host solo performance - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Victoria Sanderson The Robesonian ,\n9 hours ago LUMBERTON — My Time to Shine winner Landynn Kennedy is hosting his first solo show on July 18 at the Carolina Civic Center. Kennedy won the 2026 competition and the grand prize of $2,000 this April with his passionate performance of “Fool For You” by Cee Lo Green on the Carolina Civic Center stage. The upcoming solo show is the result of the goal Kennedy has chased since the moment the prize check fell into his hands. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 2",
